[0.0, "o", "d \u001b[94mAntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m instances, build thread-aware\n\u001b[99D\u001b[94mLocalAgentConfig\u001b[m instances (\u001b[94mGEMINI_API_KEY\u001b[m from \u001b[94m--dart-define\u001b[m or \u001b[94mPlatform.environment\u001b[m), stream response chunks\r\n\u001b[6Cvia \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk725bf4074b68acc5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L155-L165\u0007ChatRepository.streamAssistantReply\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and stop sessions on thread deletion or disposal.\u001b[K\n\u001b[90D\u2022 Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk49789634e2029c21;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L140-L227\u0007ChatViewModel.sendMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to progressively stream Markdown chunks into the assistant message bubble\r\n\u001b[6Cwhile preserving per-thread typing state and rendering structured Markdown diagnostics if an agent error occurs.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mmacOS Entitlements (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk17ac26b420cb00db;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/macos/Runner/DebugProfile.entitlements\u0007D\u001b[22mebugProfile.entitlements\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]"]
